        <strong>THE SHORT ANSWER</strong>
        <p>The useful question is not simply how much an HVAC lead costs. It is how much you spend to acquire a qualified customer opportunity and whether the resulting jobs justify the full acquisition cost.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hv-article-cta">
